    {
      "body": "Should be pretty-well supported:\nhttp://caniuse.com/#feat=input-event\n\nBut be careful, the order in which `input`, `change`, `keypress`, `keyup` and `keydown` are fired is tricky.\n",
      "date": 1446718596,
