    {
      "body": "@maxiloc If you want to see how we did it in the demo: https://github.com/algolia/instant-search-demo/pull/20/files\n\n@vvo's suggestion works pretty well because it also supports cutting and deleting with the mouse, plus the case where someone might paste text on to the end of an existing query.  \n",
